		summarizeBy: none

		changedProperty = IsHidden

		annotation SummarizationSetBy = Automatic

	column PriceCategory = ```
			
			IF ( 
				'Product'[PriceCategory#] =1, 
				"Low", 
				IF ( 
					'Product'[PriceCategory#] = 2, 
					"Medium" ,
					"High"
				)
			) 
			```
		lineageTag: a471cd0c-5d68-4443-a173-2a16cbabee56
